+ * view delta applies to where n . p + d > 0 are discarded: the window's plane, so what the game camera
+ * sees in front of it is not drawn and what is behind it shows. Off at the end of each frame.
+ */
+#define GX_AURORA_SET_CLIP_PLANE 0x0053
